                <head>Rejoinder of the party claimant to the counter memorandum of the defendant
                    party to the honorable arbitrator, Mr. T. M. C. Asser, Counsellor of State of
                    the Kingdom of the Netherlands.</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">in the arbitration to regulate the
                        differences between the government of the united states of america, party
                        claimant, and the imperial government of russia, party defendant, relative
                        to the arrests and seizures of the american vessels, cape horn pigeon, james
                        hamilton lewis, c. h. white, and kate and anna.</hi></p>
